return {
    ["\n　　当午夜的钟声敲响，当星辰在天幕闪烁，当你在梦境与现实的边界徘徊——你听到了吗？那来自深处的低语，那安宁的呼唤。\n\n　　我们是安魂诗社。\n\n　　在女神的注视下，我们是夜晚的守护者，是亡者的歌者，是秘密的守卫。我们相信：\n\n　　黑夜不是恐惧的源头，而是安宁的居所。死亡不是终结的悲哀，而是解脱的开始。我们用诗歌抚慰失眠者，用仪式安抚亡灵，用沉默守护那些不能言说的秘密。\n\n　　若你愿意加入我们，请在新月之夜来到拉斐尔墓园深处，吟诵祷词：\n\n　　\"女神啊，请让安宁降临，\n　　让梦境包裹疲惫的灵魂，\n　　让黑夜庇护迷途的羔羊。\"\n\n　　我们会在黑暗中迎接你。\n　　我们会在静谧中认可你。\n　　我们会在诗歌中铭记你。\n\n　　但请记住，成为安魂诗社的一员，意味着你将承担起相应的责任——在他人入眠时保持清醒，在世界喧嚣时保持沉默，在光明炽烈时拥抱黑暗。\n\n　　你，准备好了吗？  愿黑夜庇护你，愿安宁与你同在。"] = "\n	When the midnight bell tolls, when the stars blink in the sky, when you wander on the boundary between dreams and reality—do you hear it? That whisper from the depths, that peaceful call.\n\n	We are the Requiem Poetry Society.\n\n	Under the Goddess's Gaze, we are the Guardians of the night, the singers for the dead, and the keepers of secrets. We believe:\n\n	The night is not the source of horror, but a dwelling of peace. Death is not the sorrow of an end, but the beginning of liberation. We use poetry to comfort the insomniac, rituals to pacify the spirits, and silence to guard those unspeakable secrets.\n\n	If you are willing to join us, please come to the depths of Raphael Cemetery on the night of the new moon and recite the prayer:\n\n	\"Oh Goddess, please let peace descend,\n	Let dreams wrap around the weary soul,\n	Let the night shelter the lost lamb.\"\n\n	We will welcome you in the darkness.\n	We will acknowledge you in the silence.\n	We will remember you in our poetry.\n\n	But please remember, becoming a member of the Requiem Poetry Society means you will shoulder corresponding responsibilities—staying awake while others sleep, remaining silent while the world is noisy, and embracing the darkness while the light is intense.\n\n	Are you ready? May the night shelter you, and may peace be with you.",
    ["\"钻头\"浮空后场地出现6处<Highlight>水池</>，每个非凡者身边出现<Highlight>电球</>自动跟踪非凡者，需将<Highlight>电球</>引入<Highlight>水池</>变成<Highlight>雷池</>。之后\"钻头\"落地开始持续随机冲锋！非凡者躲避<Highlight>雷池</>，引诱\"钻头\"踩<Highlight>雷池</>叠加<Highlight>过载</>层数，达到4层后进入<Highlight>眩晕</>状态。"] = "After \"Drill\" floats, 6 <Highlight>Water Pools</> appear on the field. <Highlight>Electric Balls</> appear around each Beyonder, automatically tracking them. Players must lead the <Highlight>Electric Balls</> into the <Highlight>Water Pools</> to turn them into <Highlight>Thunder Pools</>. Afterward, \"Drill\" lands and begins continuous random charges! Beyonders must avoid the <Highlight>Thunder Pools</> and lure \"Drill\" to step on the <Highlight>Thunder Pools</> to add stacks of <Highlight>Overload</>. Upon reaching 4 stacks, it enters a <Highlight>Stun</> state.",
